  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū nene nakabona ītī yawiza nize ū kū bing'we nalī mu būpīna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ūlū nūmupīnīhaja a bing'we, numho nani ūyo alaniyeje, ūlū īt'ūyo nalampīnīhaje dūhū ū nene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī chene nakagwandīka ū mhayo gwenūyū, ībize gīkī ūlū nūshika ko, batizūnipīnīhaja a banhū abo shiigelile baniyeje. Nguno naalī nasanije gīkī, ū būyegi bone būlī wing'we na a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nang'wandīkīlaga naalī mu shisoji shingī no, kūlwa kūluha kūtaale na kūtawa tawa mu ng'holò; naalī natī na ng'hūmbū ja kūmupīnīhaja, alīyo naalī natogilwe mubūbone ū būtogwa ūbo nalī nabo kūlwa nguno ying'we, nguno būlī būtaale no!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūnekeja ng'hūbi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ūlū munhū wenhelegije būpīna, atanipīnīhagije nene, (natizūmubuna no), alīyo ī lipandī wamupīnīhagije na a bing'we pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo gwang'wigelile lūūlū ū nsango ūyo winhilwe na bingī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īlī hambū hambū mumonele shigongo na kūnūngūja, atizūminyiwa būdito wa būpīna, nose agwe ng'holò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, nalīng'wikūmbīlīja mung'oolekeje ū būtogwa wing'we ūbo mulī nabo kūlwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakang'wandīkīla nguno naalī natogilwe kūmumana ūlū mulī bigwi mu yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha, būlī ng'wene ūyo ng'ūnekeja mhayo gose gose, nū nene nanekejaga. Ūlū alī na mhayo gose gose, nanekejaga mu būtongi bo ng'wa Kilisito kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūtatogilwe ū Shetani atwibange nose atūheebe, nguno tūtījimīīlilwe ī nyasala sala yakwe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūdidohelwa mu moyo ha numa kwifuula",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nashika Tiloa kūjilomeela ī Ng'hūlū Jawiza ja ng'wa Kilisito, ū Seeba ūnilugūlīla nyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene nakabiza natī na kwifuula ū mu moyo gone, nguno natansangile koi ū ndūgū one ū Tito; nūkalīla kūbalaga dūhū, nūbūūka kūja Makedonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Mulungu alūmve, ūyo akatwinhaga būtindi gwa gwa gwa mulī Kilisito, nīyo hangī būlī kwene ūko tūkūbītaga akūjaga ūtūūla ng'waso gwa kūmana wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūlī Mulungu tūlī ng'waso gwawiza kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Kilisito, ībize kū bapījiwa nūūlū kū bajimīīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū bajimīīji tūlī inyema lya lūfu, lya kwenha icha! Lelo ū kū bapījiwa tūlī ng'waso gwa būpanga, gwa kwenha būpanga! Nani ūyo igeleelilwe ū kwīyīta ī yenīyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bise tūtī gīt'ūmo bingī bakwītīlaga, abo bakūgūtūmamīlaga ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu kwikoobela nīīlo; alīyo tūkūsomboolaga mu ng'hana kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu, gīt'ūmo shibigelile banhū ba ng'wa Mulungu mulī Kilisito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
